# The positive control for p6_tree_speed_fast's bound (physics catalog plan,
# ruled 2026-10-05, "Only ticks past the floor"): the same run with a 10 ms
# stall planted in the budget's clock every 97th reading
# (tree.html?nodes=300&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=max&physics_plant_stall_ms=10).
# A stall inside a tick the gate admitted ends it past the budget, so the
# bound p6_tree_speed_fast holds must see it: this receipt asserts the miss.
assert snap ready == true
assert snap physics-speed == max
assert snap physics-budget-share == 0.5
assert snap physics-budget-margin-us == 200
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == false
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
settle 10
timing start speed-fast-planted
settle 30
timing stop
log-physics fast-planted
log-pace fast-planted
assert snap physics-budget-bound == true
assert snap pace-gated-frames >= 1
assert snap pace-over-grain-frames >= 1
assert snap pace-over-budget-worst-us >= 1000
assert snap finite == true
log p6 speed fast planted control complete
